{
  "data": {
    "id": "ACT.19.23-ACT.19.40",
    "orgId": "ACT.19.23-ACT.19.40",
    "bibleId": "7644de2e4c5188e5-01",
    "bookId": "ACT",
    "chapterIds": [
      "ACT.19"
    ],
    "reference": "ΠΡΑΞΕΙΣ ΑΠΟΣΤΟΛΩΝ 19:23-40",
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἐγένετο δὲ κατὰ τὸν καιρὸν ἐκεῖνον τάραχος οὐκ ὀλίγος περὶ τῆς ὁδοῦ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.23",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.23"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Δημήτριος γάρ τις ὀνόματι, ἀργυροκόπος, ποιῶν ναοὺς ἀργυροῦς Ἀρτέμιδος, παρείχετο τοῖς τεχνίταις ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.24"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐργασίαν οὐκ ὀλίγην· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.24"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὓς συναθροίσας, καὶ τοὺς περὶ τὰ τοιαῦτα ἐργάτας, εἶπεν, Ἄνδρες, ἐπίστασθε ὅτι ἐκ ταύτης τῆς ἐργασίας ἡ εὐπορία ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.25"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἡμῶν ἐστι. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.25"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ θεωρεῖτε καὶ ἀκούετε ὅτι οὐ μόνον Ἐφέσου, ἀλλὰ σχεδὸν πάσης τῆς Ἀσίας, ὁ Παῦλος οὗτος πείσας μετέστησεν ἱκανὸν ὄχλον, λέγων ὅτι οὐκ εἰσὶ θεοὶ οἱ διὰ χειρῶν γινόμενοι. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.26"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οὐ μόνον δὲ τοῦτο κινδυνεύει ἡμῖν τὸ μέρος εἰς ἀπελεγμὸν ἐλθεῖν, ἀλλὰ καὶ τὸ τῆς μεγάλης θεᾶς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.27"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἱερὸν Ἀρτέμιδος εἰς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.27"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὐθὲν λογισθῆναι, μέλλειν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.27"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "δὲ καὶ καθαιρεῖσθαι ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.27"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "τὴν μεγαλειότητα αὐτῆς, ἣν ὅλη ἡ Ἀσία καὶ ἡ οἰκουμένη σέβεται.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.27"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἀκούσαντες δὲ καὶ γενόμενοι πλήρεις θυμοῦ, ἔκραζον λέγοντες, Μεγάλη ἡ Ἄρτεμις Ἐφεσίων. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.28"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ἐπλήσθη ἡ πόλις ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.29"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὅλη ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.29"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "τῆς συγχύσεως· ὥρμησάν τε ὁμοθυμαδὸν εἰς τὸ θέατρον, συναρπάσαντες Γάϊον καὶ Ἀρίσταρχον Μακεδόνας, συνεκδήμους ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.29"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Παύλου. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.29"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τοῦ δὲ Παύλου βουλομένου εἰσελθεῖν εἰς τὸν δῆμον, οὐκ εἴων αὐτὸν οἱ μαθηταί. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.30",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.30"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τινὲς δὲ καὶ τῶν Ἀσιαρχῶν, ὄντες αὐτῷ φίλοι, πέμψαντες πρὸς αὐτόν, παρεκάλουν μὴ δοῦναι ἑαυτὸν εἰς τὸ θέατρον. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.31"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἄλλοι μὲν οὖν ἄλλο τι ἔκραζον· ἦν γὰρ ἡ ἐκκλησία ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.32"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "συγκεχυμένη, καὶ οἱ πλείους οὐκ ᾔδεισαν τίνος ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.32"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἕνεκεν συνεληλύθεισαν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.32"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἐκ δὲ τοῦ ὄχλου ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.33"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "προεβίβασαν Ἀλέξανδρον, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.33"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "προβαλόντων αὐτὸν τῶν Ἰουδαίων. Ὁ δὲ Ἀλέξανδρος, κατασείσας τὴν χεῖρα, ἤθελεν ἀπολογεῖσθαι τῷ δήμῳ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.33"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἐπιγνόντες δὲ ὅτι Ἰουδαῖός ἐστι, φωνὴ ἐγένετο μία ἐκ πάντων ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὡς ἐπὶ ὥρας δύο κραζόντων, Μεγάλη ἡ Ἄρτεμις Ἐφεσίων. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καταστείλας δὲ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.35"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὁ γραμματεὺς τὸν ὄχλον φησίν, Ἄνδρες Ἐφέσιοι, τίς γάρ ἐστιν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.35"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἄνθρωπος ὃς οὐ γινώσκει τὴν Ἐφεσίων πόλιν νεωκόρον οὖσαν τῆς μεγάλης ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.35"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "θεᾶς Ἀρτέμιδος καὶ τοῦ Διοπετοῦς; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.35"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἀναντιρρήτων οὖν ὄντων τούτων, δέον ἐστὶν ὑμᾶς κατεσταλμένους ὑπάρχειν, καὶ μηδὲν προπετὲς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.36"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "πράσσειν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.36"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἠγάγετε γὰρ τοὺς ἄνδρας τούτους, οὔτε ἱεροσύλους οὔτε βλασφημοῦντας τὴν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.37"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "θεὸν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.37"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὑμῶν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.37"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εἰ μὲν οὖν Δημήτριος καὶ οἱ σὺν αὐτῷ τεχνῖται ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.38"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἔχουσι πρός τινα λόγον, ἀγοραῖοι ἄγονται, καὶ ἀνθύπατοί εἰσιν· ἐγκαλείτωσαν ἀλλήλοις. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.38"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εἰ δέ τι ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.39"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "περὶ ἑτέρων ἐπιζητεῖτε, ἐν τῇ ἐννόμῳ ἐκκλησίᾳ ἐπιλυθήσεται. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.39"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ γὰρ κινδυνεύομεν ἐγκαλεῖσθαι στάσεως περὶ τῆς σήμερον, μηδενὸς αἰτίου ὑπάρχοντος περὶ οὗ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.40"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὐ δυνησόμεθα ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.40"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "δοῦναι λόγον ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.40"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "τῆς συστροφῆς ταύτης. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ACT.19.40"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verseCount": 18,
    "copyright": "Public Domain",
    "parallels": [
      {
        "id": "ACT.19.23-ACT.19.40",
        "orgId": "ACT.19.23-ACT.19.40",
        "bibleId": "de4e12af7f28f599-01",
        "bookId": "ACT",
        "chapterIds": [
          "ACT.19"
        ],
        "reference": "Acts 19:23-40",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "And the same time there arose no small stir about that way. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.23",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.23"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For a certain ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.24"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "man",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.24"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " named Demetrius, a silversmith, which made silver shrines for Diana, brought no small gain unto the craftsmen; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.24"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Whom he called together with the workmen of like occupation, and said, Sirs, ye know that by this craft we have our wealth. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.25"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Moreover ye see and hear, that not alone at Ephesus, but almost throughout all Asia, this Paul hath persuaded and turned away much people, saying that they be no gods, which are made with hands: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.26"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "So that not only this our craft is in danger to be set at nought; but also that the temple of the great goddess Diana should be despised, and her magnificence should be destroyed, whom all Asia and the world worshippeth. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.27"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And when they heard ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.28"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "these sayings",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.28"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": ", they were full of wrath, and cried out, saying, Great ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.28"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.28"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " Diana of the Ephesians. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.28"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And the whole city was filled with confusion: and having caught Gaius and Aristarchus, men of Macedonia, Paul’s companions in travel, they rushed with one accord into the theatre. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.29"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And when Paul would have entered in unto the people, the disciples suffered him not. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.30",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.30"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And certain of the chief of Asia, which were his friends, sent unto him, desiring ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.31"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "him",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.31"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " that he would not adventure himself into the theatre. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.31"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Some therefore cried one thing, and some another: for the assembly was confused; and the more part knew not wherefore they were come together. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.32"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And they drew Alexander out of the multitude, the Jews putting him forward. And Alexander beckoned with the hand, and would have made his defence unto the people. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.33"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "But when they knew that he was a Jew, all with one voice about the space of two hours cried out, Great ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.34"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.34"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " Diana of the Ephesians. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.34"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And when the townclerk had appeased the people, he said, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.35"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Ye",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.35"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " men of Ephesus, what man is there that knoweth not how that the city of the Ephesians is a worshipper of the great goddess Diana, and of the ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.35"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "image",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ACT.19.35"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " which fell down from Jupiter? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.35"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Seeing then that these things cannot be spoken against, ye ought to be quiet, and to do nothing rashly. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.36"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For ye have brought hither these men, which are neither robbers of churches, nor yet blasphemers of your goddess. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.37"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Wherefore if Demetrius, and the craftsmen which are with him, have a matter against any man, the law is open, and there are deputies: let them implead one another. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.38"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "But if ye enquire any thing concerning other matters, it shall be determined in a lawful assembly. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.39"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For we are in danger to be called in question for this day’s uproar, there being no cause whereby we may give an account of this concourse. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ACT.19.40"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "verseCount": 18,
